  "description": "Years of production: 2018-2019\n\nThe second generation FlareMAX was our 29\" wheel, fast and fun trail bike: a proper sweet-spot chassis. Light and responsive yet fiercely capable, it was plenty of bike for big hills while staying engaging on mellow, flowy trails. Big wheels and mid travel, with 120mm or 132mm rear travel options. As Singletrack magazine put it, the FlareMAX does fast, fun and far.\n\nFinishes: Gloss Blue with Orange, Dark Metal and Mercury.\nSizes: Small (new for Gen2), Medium, Large and XL.",
